    "number": 38,
    "summary": "The battle of Gog, from the land of Magog, against Israel will usher in the Second Coming—The Lord will come amid war and pestilence, and all men will shake at His presence.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And the word of the Lord came unto me, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
